    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/486eca297288465d3f7e118a1f5e8338.poster.avif?t=1748919600\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/486eca297288465d3f7e118a1f5e8338.apng?t=1748919600\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/708b060eeca93c4fece6dafe00653ba2.poster.avif?t=1748919600\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/708b060eeca93c4fece6dafe00653ba2.apng?t=1748919600\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/2591b0cfd9bac29adcfb6c793af4882a.poster.avif?t=1748919600\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/2591b0cfd9bac29adcfb6c793af4882a.apng?t=1748919600\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/51f429df29991dea1c54894c2dad7b35.poster.avif?t=1748919600\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/51f429df29991dea1c54894c2dad7b35.apng?t=1748919600\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/c9275365d33f3183e78b7fc4311ba98b.avif?t=1748919600\" /></div><br><br>A Humanist retro-style RPG game about sincerity and empathy, featuring friendly robot dogs and evil smiley faces.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/5eaf852f74d77431bc7557ae210e9e02.avif?t=1748919600\" /></div><br><br>Explore the worlds of two separate casts of characters embarked upon their own unique quests, alternating back and forth as their seemingly unrelated stories creep closer and closer together.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/2f5d6c77b1b86debfb6a8947f1f967e1.avif?t=1748919600\" /></div><br><br>Engage with a wide variety of unique and unusual enemies in turn based combat mixed with bullet hell style dodge mechanics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/68a2fb16b6128706c58b8a8fd0dfb419.avif?t=1748919600\" /></div><br><br>Fight to unconver the mystery of he whom holds the ground up to our feet...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699260/extras/4ad026a0e91b8775f7cf1ac7ec3ee68c.avif?t=1748919600\" /></div>",
